  "description": "Russell Estate Agents present to the market this superb four bedroom detached home set on an elevated position overlooking the entrance to Cork Harbour.  The property is one of the finest properties to come on the rental market in Cork in recent times. The property is located at Whitebay just a short drive from the village of Whitegate and less than 15 minutes from Midleton town.  Cork City is just 30 minutes from the property.  The property is finished to an exceptional high standard and comes fully furnished throughout with very high quality furnishings.   It has an excellent B2 Ber Rating \n\nThe property is set on an elevated site enjoying panoramic views over the entrance of Cork Harbour including Fort Carlisle across to Fort Camden onthe Crosshaven side.  Properties of this calibre do not come to the rental market too often in Cork so be sure to take this opportunity an contact us today. \n.\n\nACCOMODATION\n\nEntrance porch, entrance hallway, open plan kitchen / dining / living room, sitting room, four bedrooms two ensuite family bathroom and first floor lounge with doors leading out onto a balcony.\n\nDIRECTIONS\n\nFrom Midleton take the R630 Whitegate road.  Travel ahead to Whitegate Village.  Pass through the village and continue ahead for 1.5 kilometres.  Take the turn up to the right hand side and continue up the hill.  You will arrive at Whitebay Beach carpark on your right hand side and the property will be on your left hand side.\n\n\nAPPLICATION PROCESS\n\nAll applications for this property should be made exclusively by emailing our office at info@russellproperty.ie\n\nVIEWING\n\nAll viewings of this property must be arranged through the selling agents Russell Estate Agents Limited. Our office hours are Monday to Friday 9am to 5pm.  We can arrange evening and weekend viewings by prior appointment.\n\n\nNOTICE\n\nRussell Estate Agents for the vendors or lessors of this property whose agents they are, give notice that: (i) The particulars are set out as a general outline for the guidance of intending purchasers or lessees, and do not institute, nor constitute part of, an offer or contract.",
